"Pay in cash when your furniture arrives. No advance for in-stock pieces."},{"icon":"inspect","title":"Inspect before you pay","text":"Check every detail at your door, then pay once you are happy."},{"icon":"truck","title":"Free delivery nationwide","text":"Delivered and placed in your room across all major cities."},{"icon":"craft","title":"Handcrafted quality","text":"Solid woods and careful joinery from our own workshop."}]}},{"id":"649f7d77-a44f-4ea4-8039-b80d13597dda","type":"testimonials","eyebrow":"Kind words","title":"From homes across Pakistan","subtitle":null,"is_visible":true,"sort_order":7,"settings":{"limit":8}},{"id":"f3aecfe0-e9f5-4b5d-82f7-187ee027209b","type":"story","eyebrow":"Our story","title":"Made slowly, for homes that are lived in","subtitle":null,"is_visible":true,"sort_order":8,"settings":{"image":{"ref":"/demo/desk-wall-oak.webp","alt":"A quiet corner with a wooden desk and chair","w":1600,"h":2133,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnoAAABXRUJQVlA4IG4AAACwAwCdASoQABUAPu1iqk2ppaQiMAgBMB2JYgCdACHaii7Sij93QAD+1lzJoO2MoAbFKH2epOx9pgvQhmyhyt/IEdjtItWFXQj0CdAFGBUD5SJKZscCvC1Gc/tM6gfeCdLkzB7IywyMF3uzsAAAAA=="},"body":"Looma Comfort began with a simple belief: good furniture should feel as good in ten years as it does on the day it arrives. We work with skilled craftsmen and honest materials, sheesham, mango and oak, and we finish every piece by hand.\n\nWe design for real family life in Pakistan: long dinners, guests who stay late, children who climb on everything. Our pieces are built to handle all of it, quietly and beautifully.","button_label":"Shop now","button_url":"/shop","stats":[{"value":5000,"suffix":"+","label":"Happy homes"},{"value":40,"suffix":"+","label":"Cities delivered"},{"value":100,"suffix":"%","label":"Inspected before payment"}]}}]'::jsonb)
on conflict (id) do nothing;

insert into public.reviews (id, product_id, customer_name, city, rating, title, body, source, status, is_featured, review_date, created_at)
select id, product_id, customer_name, city, rating, title, body, source, status, is_featured, review_date, created_at from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::public.reviews, '[{"id":"34db3900-1318-405b-ad31-72464a5c3a31","product_id":"639a0d3f-3c49-45d6-995a-13bd41bdc34c","customer_name":"Ayesha K.","city":"Lahore","rating":5,"title":null,"body":"The leather is beautiful and the sofa is even more comfortable than it looked. Delivery team placed it carefully and waited while I checked every seam.","source":"website","status":"approved","is_featured":true,"review_date":"2026-09-10","created_at":"2026-09-10T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"fa83ba37-4849-4672-9dde-f9714b243084","product_id":"0caceef0-0748-4ed3-a55b-45f6633fbb29","customer_name":"Hamza R.","city":"Karachi","rating":5,"title":null,"body":"Solid, heavy and perfectly finished. We ordered the six-chair set on WhatsApp and it arrived in exactly the time they promised.","source":"whatsapp","status":"approved","is_featured":true,"review_date":"2026-08-11","created_at":"2026-08-11T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"94938ad2-52fd-47d9-ae8d-e0f07fa7b4cf","product_id":"d425fdc3-1dc2-42d0-936e-6be55858ec5a","customer_name":"Sana M.","city":"Islamabad","rating":5,"title":null,"body":"Our bedroom finally feels finished. The tufting is neat and the headboard is lovely to lean on while reading.","source":"website","status":"approved","is_featured":true,"review_date":"2026-07-12","created_at":"2026-07-12T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"2100ed38-cbce-48b9-8c74-126a4fce6b03","product_id":"5a3be482-77ce-4d93-a038-4c38b882b449","customer_name":"Usman T.","city":"Faisalabad","rating":5,"title":null,"body":"You can tell this is real sheesham. The grain is gorgeous and the finish is smooth. Paid cash on delivery after checking it.","source":"whatsapp","status":"approved","is_featured":true,"review_date":"2026-09-13","created_at":"2026-09-13T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"78d959fa-71f1-4cfb-ae04-d6ac93a89ccd","product_id":"13c9d85f-7620-42ee-a963-79d10ec84968","customer_name":"Mehwish A.","city":"Rawalpindi","rating":5,"title":null,"body":"Ordered in sage instead of mustard and they sent fabric photos on WhatsApp before making it. Very personal service.","source":"website","status":"approved","is_featured":true,"review_date":"2026-08-14","created_at":"2026-08-14T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"1be1d9d1-690e-41dc-b4aa-e37322a3284e","product_id":"021764f1-9712-4204-b0a0-0c9bcbe7be96","customer_name":"Bilal S.","city":"Multan","rating":5,"title":null,"body":"Small but beautifully made. Bought two for either side of the bed and they look much more expensive than they were.","source":"whatsapp","status":"approved","is_featured":true,"review_date":"2026-07-15","created_at":"2026-07-15T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"c4872ae3-9b32-404a-aa07-5781fc2bc948","product_id":"13a63da9-967e-4130-b418-755bf0abb542","customer_name":"Fatima Z.","city":"Peshawar","rating":4,"title":null,"body":"Lovely colour and very soft. I would have liked one more cushion included.","source":"website","status":"pending","is_featured":false,"review_date":"2026-10-10","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:00:00.000Z"}]'::jsonb)
on conflict (id) do nothing;

insert into public.pages (id, slug, title, intro, body_html, blocks, hero_image, seo_title, seo_description)
select id, slug, title, intro, body_html, blocks, hero_image, seo_title, seo_description from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::public.pages, '[{"id":"7f6edc8c-fe4f-4edb-846d-534e1d5583dd","slug":"about","title":"Furniture for a better home","intro":"We make honest, beautiful furniture for the way families in Pakistan really live.","body_html":"<p>Looma Comfort started in a small workshop with a simple idea: furniture should be built to be used, every day, for years. Not to be replaced the moment it shows a scratch.</p><p>Today we work with skilled carpenters, carvers and upholsterers across Punjab. Our frames are kiln-dried so they do not warp in our summers. Our joints are cut, glued and pinned, not just stapled. And every piece is checked twice before it leaves us, then once more by you at your door.</p>","blocks":{"sections":[{"heading":"Honest materials","body":"Solid sheesham from Punjab, reclaimed mango wood and carefully chosen fabrics. We tell you exactly what each piece is made of, down to the foam density.","image":{"ref":"/demo/console-sheesham.webp","alt":"Solid sheesham console with dovetailed drawers","w":1600,"h":1067,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRkQAAABXRUJQVlA4IDgAAADwAQCdASoQAAsAA4BaJZQAAudjdA32oAAA/u/JLa3ysWtDZiBKCYix9LsDNHt5GpYBPPrN+UQAAA=="}},{"heading":"Made by hand, finished with care","body":"Each piece is sanded, stained and finished by hand. It takes longer, and it is the reason our furniture looks better with age.","image":{"ref":"/demo/armchair-carved.webp","alt":"A hand-carved sheesham armchair","w":1600,"h":2400,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRogAAABXRUJQVlA4IHwAAACwAwCdASoQABgAPu1iqU2ppaOiMAgBMB2JQAAHhG+3yxPHr8DuAAD+r2/vlraF6sLlnfdOJjtJgAzE3ja8m75QavsNuqokqkmfdlWEVZ+Y+9X8naT35OoOtECVM0PDhb5QyXvW1LFOd369xBuWanL6Xzy4t5GEEIAwIAAA"}}],"values":[{"title":"Built to last","text":"Kiln-dried frames, real joinery and hardware chosen for decades, not seasons."},{"title":"Fair and transparent","text":"Clear prices, no hidden charges, and cash on delivery for in-stock pieces."},{"title":"Personal service","text":"Talk to a real person on WhatsApp before, during and after your order."},{"title":"Made for your space","text":"Most pieces can be adjusted in size, fabric or finish to fit your home."}],"steps":[{"title":"Selecting the wood","text":"We choose seasoned sheesham and mango wood, then kiln-dry it to prevent warping."},{"title":"Joinery and frame","text":"Frames are cut, glued and pinned with mortise-and-tenon and dovetail joints."},{"title":"Hand finishing","text":"Every surface is sanded, stained and sealed by hand in our workshop."},{"title":"Quality check","text":"Each piece is inspected twice before it is wrapped and sent to you."}],"gallery":[{"ref":"/demo/living-round-tables.webp","alt":"Round sheesham tables in a living room","w":1600,"h":2400,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRpIAAABXRUJQVlA4IIYAAAAwBACdASoQABgAPu1iqU2ppaQiMAgBMB2JZQAD5LHk+Jr0kXbl4aacUAAA+gqBx+BMKCNaEhk2cC0+yP2ssROzV5/t49SDW/GlWn2zlZpMptGdMXLO2oIYANFlcjgj+mpnCwmP/8nKdSjHfprmd52ZmkiEekgwZmI4ulbG0kEm7fiiQjAAAA=="},{"ref":"/demo/bedroom-calm.webp","alt":"A calm bedroom","w":1600,"h":900,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmYAAABXRUJQVlA4IFoAAACwAQCdASoQAAkAA4BaJQBOgBk2q8IAAP7YZ19yHqzcFYbbtaVBvbe48jOnWBBUf7X4bt4HVIbYdJ2D7YAptxgzzGh3ftMmnauob0txqMlmBJgrefVIpDKwAAA="},{"ref":"/demo/dining-room-bright.webp","alt":"A bright dining room","w":1600,"h":2400,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRqgAAABXRUJQVlA4IJwAAABQBACdASoQABgAPu1iqU2ppaQiMAgBMB2JQBWAMYYcEPADxrzDWaEHiR4AAP7uDm/UzlXgeyi16AGoQZhUsEFzdGvSe1+oivHVLgSCLUSfmoqZXj3mJR/xZQMLtcfy7+1V/Ou+DhDYeqoVX1nnYRrqHpASTC89+sC2xICjzQdBMqV6HTqXHjk6RcdL69iVtMqP0fU7IwEDeCjtkAA="}],"stats":[{"value":5000,"suffix":"+","label":"Happy homes"},{"value":40,"suffix":"+","label":"Cities delivered"},{"value":12,"suffix":"","label":"Master craftsmen"}]},"hero_image":{"ref":"/demo/hero-living-pendants.webp","alt":"A styled living room with rattan pendant lamps","w":1600,"h":1600,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmoAAABXRUJQVlA4IF4AAAAQAgCdASoQABAAA4BaJYgCdADGmGPjTLzgAP6FsQQMHsvwMIQ/mvtgGBcvxS4WfU7NKT5TXB4ICK3QuiVz96BZ53AcrpwX3U4I7w2bQTxCzfWhKi/5QG4sFploYAAA"},"seo_title":null,"seo_description":null},{"id":"d24a772e-716d-45b1-bc6b-ef28b16f3f2b","slug":"customize","title":"Made to your measurements","intro":"Have a space that standard sizes do not fit, or a fabric you have fallen for? Our workshop builds furniture to order, to your size, in your finish.","body_html":"<p>Almost every piece in our collection can be adjusted, and we regularly build entirely new designs from a photo or a sketch. Send us what you have in mind on WhatsApp and we will reply with ideas, a price and a delivery time.</p>","blocks":{"options":[{"title":"Size","text":"Change the width, depth or height to fit an exact wall, alcove or room.","image":{"ref":"/demo/sofa-ivory-cloud.webp","alt":"A cream sofa","w":1600,"h":1055,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRkgAAABXRUJQVlA4IDwAAADQAQCdASoQAAsAA4BaJQBOgCKQ3s0H0AD+4iLCk4CGJMpF1PWPLdk2Q1NAbsNaspeVhrou8aku0dbbAAA="}},{"title":"Fabric & colour","text":"Choose from velvets, linens, boucle and leathers in dozens of shades.","image":{"ref":"/demo/chair-ivory-tufted.webp","alt":"A tufted accent chair","w":1600,"h":2403,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRlIAAABXRUJQVlA4IEYAAABwAwCdASoQABgAPu1iqk2ppaQiMAgBMB2JZwDA3C0AwlpInAAA/u5uI7wUctYZZ1Ec8IfHaZxGeDMW+d+v22jxUfcfrgAA"}},{"title":"Wood & finish","text":"Sheesham, mango or oak, in natural, walnut or a custom stain.","image":{"ref":"/demo/side-table-cove.webp","alt":"A solid wood side table","w":1600,"h":1067,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRkoAAABXRUJQVlA4ID4AAADwAQCdASoQAAsAA4BaJYwC7ADdHGNWsSAA/u/XlF6KHnnGWnxdD/2W/er54mh6nkVd1SdLG14jJcNTmgAAAA=="}},{"title":"Design changes","text":"Add storage, change the legs or arms, or bring us a design of your own.","image":{"ref":"/demo/armchair-carved.webp","alt":"A carved armchair","w":1600,"h":2400,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRogAAABXRUJQVlA4IHwAAACwAwCdASoQABgAPu1iqU2ppaOiMAgBMB2JQAAHhG+3yxPHr8DuAAD+r2/vlraF6sLlnfdOJjtJgAzE3ja8m75QavsNuqokqkmfdlWEVZ+Y+9X8naT35OoOtECVM0PDhb5QyXvW1LFOd369xBuWanL6Xzy4t5GEEIAwIAAA"}}],"steps":[{"title":"Share your idea","text":"Send a photo, sketch or measurements on WhatsApp."},{"title":"Consultation & quote","text":"We suggest materials and share a clear price and timeline."},{"title":"Approval","text":"Confirm the design and fabric. A small advance secures your order."},{"title":"Crafting","text":"Our workshop builds your piece, with photo updates along the way."},{"title":"Delivery & inspection","text":"We deliver and place it. Inspect everything, then pay the balance."}],"gallery":[{"ref":"/demo/console-white-mirror.webp","alt":"A console table styled under a mirror","w":1600,"h":2400,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRqoAAABXRUJQVlA4IJ4AAABwBACdASoQABgAPu1iqU2ppaOiMAgBMB2JQBibMX1b7buOzbhIf0/6ZRzngAD+yoWG1vkNz7D870wRg4tpCbZKSG2mxjGc1GTgt4Pp7XSwXn/auPBCzZ62h1zkwfhGetAX5lvHXyk/KZv4k4xP7ES4Z0YXvzD4qE2lsHrNdd7vi3WCKLSpWaopE8bCAB38PsWWfimqNHk+cn3U/IAAAA=="},{"ref":"/demo/dining-sheesham-six.webp","alt":"A sheesham dining table","w":1600,"h":2133,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRogAAABXRUJQVlA4IHwAAADQAwCdASoQABUAPu1iqU2ppaOiMAgBMB2JZACdAYvCoEoMyoN8TOAA4TnqhotqQqWCb5EDi3fWMuN73HKqgwyKf51ed7YzUHp5UHZWaHzPz3HubJI90szDQ1byVB0QsBD9bhRAL9JYob8cYIUWG8qPb8NO7DehOp3cW9wA"},{"ref":"/demo/bedroom-ottomans.webp","alt":"Custom ottomans at the end of a bed","w":1600,"h":1083,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRngAAABXRUJQVlA4IGwAAAAQAgCdASoQAAsAA4BaJbACdMn8A5Cvf9wAAOJ/rwt+AEhvYtiWFIjsPyObOfc+/5yc+hOq2kic6xAnejLYk5KhQqL67y7Y+/805nzC0dbeptbiMM61+EUNUQanZ5FWATr8AvkJ7zb4WhxgAAA="}]},"hero_image":{"ref":"/demo/desk-wall-oak.webp","alt":"A custom wall desk in oak","w":1600,"h":2133,"blur":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnoAAABXRUJQVlA4IG4AAACwAwCdASoQABUAPu1iqk2ppaQiMAgBMB2JYgCdACHaii7Sij93QAD+1lzJoO2MoAbFKH2epOx9pgvQhmyhyt/IEdjtItWFXQj0CdAFGBUD5SJKZscCvC1Gc/tM6gfeCdLkzB7IywyMF3uzsAAAAA=="},"seo_title":null,"seo_description":null},{"id":"e4cffc09-f99d-4ce0-b369-71d3ce4f4e1a","slug":"shipping","title":"Shipping & Delivery","intro":"How and when your furniture reaches you.","body_html":"<h2>Delivery areas</h2><p>We deliver to all major cities in Pakistan, including Lahore, Karachi, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad, Multan, Peshawar, Sialkot, Gujranwala and Hyderabad. For other cities, message us on WhatsApp and we will confirm availability.</p>\n<h2>Delivery charges</h2><p>Delivery is free to all major cities. For remote areas a small charge may apply, which we will always confirm before you order.</p>\n<h2>Delivery times</h2><ul><li><strong>In-stock pieces:</strong> 5 to 7 working days.</li><li><strong>Made-to-order and custom pieces:</strong> 3 to 4 weeks, confirmed at the time of order.</li></ul>\n<h2>On the day</h2><p>Our team will call you before arriving. We carry your furniture into the room of your choice, attach legs where needed and remove the packaging.</p>\n<h2>Inspect before you pay</h2><p>Please check your order carefully at delivery. If anything is not right, tell our team before paying and we will make it right.</p>","blocks":{},"hero_image":null,"seo_title":null,"seo_description":null},{"id":"7c58385b-dbf3-462a-b3c9-3d5905a09ac8","slug":"refund-and-returns","title":"Refund & Return Policy","intro":"Our promise if something is not right.","body_html":"<h2>Inspection at delivery</h2><p>Because you can inspect your furniture before paying, most issues are resolved on the spot. If a piece is damaged or does not match your order, you may refuse delivery at no cost.</p>\n<h2>After delivery</h2><p>If you notice a manufacturing defect within 7 days of delivery, contact us on WhatsApp with photos. We will repair or replace the piece free of charge.</p>\n<h2>Change of mind</h2><p>In-stock pieces may be returned within 7 days in their original condition. A return delivery charge applies. Custom and made-to-order pieces cannot be returned for a change of mind.</p>\n<h2>Refunds</h2><p>Approved refunds are made by bank transfer within 7 working days of collection.</p>\n<h2>Warranty</h2><p>Sofa and bed frames carry a warranty against structural defects. The length of warranty is listed on each product page.</p>","blocks":{},"hero_image":null,"seo_title":null,"seo_description":null},{"id":"98b982a9-06b4-493a-803a-76176a526308","slug":"privacy","title":"Privacy Policy","intro":"How we handle your information.","body_html":"<h2>What we collect</h2><p>When you contact us or place an order on WhatsApp, we receive your name, phone number, delivery address and the details of your order. If you subscribe to our newsletter, we store your email address.</p>\n<h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use your information only to respond to you, arrange delivery and, if you have agreed, send you occasional news about new arrivals and offers.</p>\n<h2>Analytics</h2><p>Our website uses analytics tools to understand how visitors use it. These tools may use cookies. They do not tell us who you are.</p>\n<h2>Sharing</h2><p>We never sell your information. We share delivery details only with our delivery partners, and only for your order.</p>\n<h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can ask us to update or delete your information at any time by messaging us on WhatsApp or by email.</p>","blocks":{},"hero_image":null,"seo_title":null,"seo_description":null},{"id":"fecde782-01f6-43a1-b713-325c8e8a7ddb","slug":"terms","title":"Terms of Service","intro":"The terms that apply when you use this website and order from us.","body_html":"<h2>Orders</h2><p>Orders are placed and confirmed on WhatsApp. An order is confirmed once we send you a confirmation message with the price and delivery time.</p>\n<h2>Prices</h2><p>All prices are in Pakistani Rupees (PKR). We try to keep prices accurate; if a price on the website is shown in error, we will contact you before confirming your order.</p>\n<h2>Product appearance</h2><p>Solid wood is a natural material and each piece has its own grain and tone. Colours may look slightly different on screen.</p>\n<h2>Custom orders</h2><p>Custom pieces are made to your specification and may require an advance payment, which is confirmed in writing before work begins.</p>\n<h2>Contact</h2><p>For any question about these terms, contact us on WhatsApp or by email.</p>","blocks":{},"hero_image":null,"seo_title":null,"seo_description":null}]'::jsonb)
on conflict (id) do nothing;

insert into public.faqs (id, question, answer_html, group_name, sort_order, is_visible, show_on_customize)
select id, question, answer_html, group_name, sort_order, is_visible, show_on_customize from jsonb_populate_recordset(null::public.faqs, '[{"id":"1d2ceb7d-a9af-4252-9773-425b3fd21390","question":"How do I place an order?","answer_html":"<p>Choose your piece and options on the website, then tap <strong>Order on WhatsApp</strong>. Your order details are filled in for you; just press send and our team will confirm availability, price and delivery time.</p>","group_name":"Orders","sort_order":0,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"8b7c9669-243b-4304-aa7d-761fc45866ba","question":"Can I order more than one item at once?","answer_html":"<p>Yes. Add pieces to your wishlist with the heart icon, then open your wishlist and tap <strong>Send my list on WhatsApp</strong>.</p>","group_name":"Orders","sort_order":1,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"09adc10f-ce0b-4ef8-b6fe-8cada120dc4e","question":"Do you offer cash on delivery?","answer_html":"<p>Yes. In-stock pieces are paid for in cash when they are delivered, after you have inspected them.</p>","group_name":"Payment","sort_order":2,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"4bd9229d-11fe-4376-a174-d7ff50738558","question":"Do I need to pay an advance?","answer_html":"<p>No advance is needed for in-stock pieces. Custom and made-to-order pieces need a small advance to begin production, confirmed before we start.</p>","group_name":"Payment","sort_order":3,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"958f5be5-c57c-4696-9d4d-4693e5004d7c","question":"How long does delivery take?","answer_html":"<p>In-stock pieces arrive in 5 to 7 working days. Made-to-order pieces take 3 to 4 weeks.</p>","group_name":"Delivery","sort_order":4,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"776047b9-ce12-4e4c-82c3-f31793c4736a","question":"Is delivery free?","answer_html":"<p>Delivery is free to all major cities in Pakistan. For remote areas we will confirm any charge before you order.</p>","group_name":"Delivery","sort_order":5,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"c4b607c9-faf0-4774-bdca-5fbbb731c4c6","question":"Can I inspect my order before paying?","answer_html":"<p>Absolutely. Check every detail at your door and pay only when you are happy.</p>","group_name":"Delivery","sort_order":6,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"fd131988-c86d-4a25-a88c-4612cd72050f","question":"Is your furniture made of solid wood?","answer_html":"<p>Many of our pieces are solid sheesham or mango wood. Each product page lists exactly what the piece is made of.</p>","group_name":"Products & Care","sort_order":7,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"85afb626-603c-4c39-8760-97f0be8435c3","question":"How do I care for sheesham wood?","answer_html":"<p>Dust with a soft dry cloth, wipe spills straight away and keep the piece out of direct sunlight. A little furniture wax twice a year keeps the finish rich.</p>","group_name":"Products & Care","sort_order":8,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"ace176b7-9730-40d8-8c5b-a359fd8b8dd2","question":"Can you make a piece in a custom size?","answer_html":"<p>Yes. Most of our designs can be made in a different size, fabric or finish. Visit our <a href=\"/customize\">custom furniture page</a> or send us your measurements on WhatsApp.</p>","group_name":"Custom Orders","sort_order":9,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":true},{"id":"f7e1e473-9192-45ae-a812-8af5357735d8","question":"How long do custom orders take?","answer_html":"<p>Usually 3 to 4 weeks, depending on the design. We confirm the timeline before you approve the order.</p>","group_name":"Custom Orders","sort_order":10,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":true},{"id":"f2594b3f-3d6c-4d86-98e8-bd4de77133d4","question":"Can I see fabric samples?","answer_html":"<p>Yes. We share photos and videos of fabrics on WhatsApp, and you are welcome to visit to see them in person.</p>","group_name":"Custom Orders","sort_order":11,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":true},{"id":"0046628d-d17a-479a-bd01-1927354b18dc","question":"What if something arrives damaged?","answer_html":"<p>Refuse the delivery or tell our team before paying, and we will replace or repair it at no cost to you.</p>","group_name":"Returns","sort_order":12,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false},{"id":"72ea4309-7e2e-445c-97c1-79678b71a6ea","question":"Can I return a piece if I change my mind?","answer_html":"<p>In-stock pieces can be returned within 7 days in original condition; a return delivery charge applies. Custom pieces cannot be returned for a change of mind.</p>","group_name":"Returns","sort_order":13,"is_visible":true,"show_on_customize":false}]'::jsonb)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
